C. BThere are 13 months in the year. Each month holds unique attributes.

Visitors in the 50s are from the golden record Voyager 1977

Having a child is a very high cost, and if you don't pay that cost they WILL take your child and give it to someone who will pay.

A bunch of generations passed and people are playing a video game war but now they think it's real.

Medical science has found a way to revive people who have been dead for up to 2 weeks. The results seem perfect at first but soon the consequences are revealed

The phone rings. An automated sounding voice speaks slowly. The couple realizes that they have been found. There is a knock at the door and a family member is there looking....hallow.

A kid realizes he has the ability to create and shape the world around him. He becomes part of a group of kids trying to take down the corporate governments and the shadowy people who control it and restore the ancient order that's long since been buried and forgotten.

A girls close uncle whom owns a antique shop falls into a sudden and unexplainable coma. She must unravel the mystery behind his coma, a note he sent and the picture of a mystery cabin etched into the wood cover of a special antique box before time runs out and her family does the unthinkable and pulls the plug.